# Build context of airflow/Dockerfile (context = repo root). Allowlist: only the
# code the pipeline runs goes into the image; never data, keys, .env or local state.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!ingestion/
!alerting/
!lineage/
!airflow/dags/
!airflow/check_dags.py
!airflow/plugins/
# Elementary CLI lock (edr venv)
!.github/edr-requirements.txt
!transform/
transform/target/
transform/target_airflow/
transform/dbt_packages/
transform/logs/
transform/edr_target/
transform/.user.yml
**/__pycache__/
